two nested loop is O(n^2)
three nested loop is O(n^3)

Algorithms with running time O(2^N)
are often "RECURSIVE" algorithms that solve a problem of size N by recursively solving two smaller problems of size N-1.
like "Towers of Hanoi" problem for N disks

