All the standard functionality of stack is O(1)
if we use bio direction linked-list under the hood it always be O(1)
if the stack is resizable (we have not the StackOverFlowException)
we could have O(n) scenario (when dynamic array is getting resize)
(if stack is not resizable, it always O(1))

